  & =|\\begin{aligned}{e}^{x} & {e}^{2x} \\\\ {e}^{x} & 2{e}^{2x}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\cdot 2{e}^{2x}-{e}^{2x}\\cdot {e}^{x} \\\\  & =2{e}^{3x}-{e}^{3x} \\\\  & ={e}^{3x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is $\\text{nonzero for at least one }x\\in R.$\n\nTherefore, the set ${{y}_{1}(x),{y}_{2}(x)}$ is linearly $\\text{independent}$ on $R.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-334121/field-1" "q-334121/field-2" "q-334121/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fd428707-bb32-58b2-8a51-09e330af0bb1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-334121"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-334108/field-1/9d3b8c44a25cb3838512b9504ce4d17b27341fc6a07249cb7504b570f04ffbdd" :answer/id #uuid "90fffa34-6546-5497-a1e7-1cf96cbcd727" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}^{4}-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334108/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "f7b3e73f-88ba-5312-80c8-4fc859c9563c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334108/field-1/d7b8168325c2e6b4b743eea1b1fe77b1e6358a45cac231b5226de7b9658e7e35" :answer/id #uuid "deccd236-669e-5d02-ae7a-c1835104498f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334108/field-1/f7a27c1aac57e59adf4c41a0586326606ab7cb66c0166faefc28f0a6e91c997b" :answer/id #uuid "c5b4fadf-d650-551d-94cb-ea578fd5c162" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10{x}^{2}-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334108/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb3f9e12-1dd3-5b16-80e9-e83d26264aaa" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-334108/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-334108/field-1/9d3b8c44a25cb3838512b9504ce4d17b27341fc6a07249cb7504b570f04ffbdd" "q-334108/field-1/d9